64\n- Review-required: 100\n- Rejected: 0\n- Blocked/quarantined or deferred: 1,389\n- Safe consumption questions: 2,141\n- Predicates covered: 5\n- Topic/component groups: 48\n- Backlog tasks: 1,489, non-blocking for V1-safe RAG/Copilot consumption\n- High-risk prerequisite/misconception/mastery auto-accepted: 0\n\n## Verification\n\n- Required first command: `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` passed before repo inspection; final rerun passed with only expected dirty-worktree warning before commit.\n- `node --check scripts/method-map/build-semantic-kg-final-v1-safe-layers.mjs`\n- `npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/method-map/__tests__/semantic-kg-final-v1-safe-layers.test.js`\n- `npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/method-map/__tests__/semantic-kg-scheduled-codex-candidate-layer.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/semantic-kg-wave1-promotion.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/semantic-kg-v1-promotion-thresholds.test.js`\n- `ESLINT_USE_FLAT_CONFIG=true npx eslint scripts/method-map/build-semantic-kg-final-v1-safe-layers.mjs scripts/method-map/__tests__/semantic-kg-final-v1-safe-layers.test.js`\n- `git diff --check`\n- Post-commit `git status --short` was clean before push.\n\n## Non-goals Confirmed\n\n- No production RAG reindex.\n- No vector store mutation.\n- No remote Supabase mutation.\n- No frontend/runtime integration.\n- No external LLM/VLM/API calls.\n","created_at":"2026-07-06T16:21:41Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T16:34:08Z","closed_at":"2026-07-06T16:34:08Z","merged_at":"2026-07-06T16:34:08Z","merge_commit_sha":"7158fa02556c99e32a570f9225e18bb82c001556","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1401/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1401/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/p